      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've had an amount of fun running around with xbox controller in left hand and trying to wave at people with the right hand Oculus touch controller at the same time. The game controller has a strong priority over other hand movement. Maybe it could be delayed? Only grab hands if they've been frozen some amount of time? I'd like a second or two, because I'm just goofing around. Could try a few more seconds to be sensible...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
